  - m_Id: 68522524361613312
    m_Localized: SECRET DIFFICULTY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 68906890779926528
    m_Localized: Reroll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72024547951616000
    m_Localized: Press [{RestartButton}] to restart
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 3223126429313007719
  - m_Id: 72162566585966592
    m_Localized: 'Cards left: '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72163201205133312
    m_Localized: 'You gain negative modifiers over time; the further you progress,
      the more of them you gain.

      These modifiers cannot be exchanged.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72163200408215552
    m_Localized: Difficulty up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72163183916212224
    m_Localized: 'Receive a negative modifier that can be exchanged for a positive
      modifier in the future.

      The higher your combo points, the more powerful
      modifiers you can take, combo points will reset after taking.

      The more
      you collect, the better the reward.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72163104094412800
    m_Localized: Gain a negative modifier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72163102932590592
    m_Localized: 'Exchange your negative modifiers for positive ones.

      You
      will lose your negative modifiers.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72163102135672832
    m_Localized: Selling modifiers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101155819684601856
    m_Localized: Fight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101155820791898112
    m_Localized: continue the run
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102494569475842048
    m_Localized: Boss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101158537031557120
    m_Localized: This time, the throne is already occupied
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101158596888469504
    m_Localized: Your victory means nothing. Continue on your path
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101163715331858432
    m_Localized: It doesn't matter who wins. You'll be replaced by someone just like
      you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101163874170150912
    m_Localized: Are you ready to end here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101164813740384256
    m_Localized: It gets easier for you to get here each time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101165298845196288
    m_Localized: I am the boss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101168209063026688
    m_Localized: Are you ready for battle?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101168266906673152
    m_Localized: Hi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102282851697008640
    m_Localized: I won't stand in your way. Continue on your path
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102283085059694592
    m_Localized: Is this the end for me? Is it really all going to end here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102283180568190976
    m_Localized: Continue the journey or prepare to die
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102284126853505024
    m_Localized: How did a player like you manage to get here earlier?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102284146726117376
    m_Localized: Skill issue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102284159569076224
    m_Localized: You were so close to victory. What a shame.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102284747052654592
    m_Localized: I expected more from someone who made it this far
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102284934462545920
    m_Localized: I didn't expect such a disgrace
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102285540124237824
    m_Localized: "You\u2019ve already heard me. Let\u2019s get straight to the point"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102285615076450304
    m_Localized: And here you are again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102285662212038656
    m_Localized: You've really come a long way. Impressive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102285943851163648
    m_Localized: Welcome back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102286015238217728
    m_Localized: "It makes no sense. There\u2019s no prize waiting for you at the
      end"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103543018010943488
    m_Localized: Loop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
